graph LR
    PC["kfp-components<br/>v1.11.0<br/>(22 KFP components)"]

    %% Core Framework Dependencies
    PC -->|pipeline SDK| KFP["Kubeflow Pipelines SDK<br/>kfp >=2.16.1"]
    PC -->|K8s extensions| KFPK8s["kfp-kubernetes<br/>>=2.16.1"]
    PC -->|cluster ops| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API<br/>kubernetes ==36.0.2"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    PC -->|model serving CRs| KServe["KServe<br/>serving.kserve.io"]
    PC -->|platform provisioning| ODH["OpenDataHub Infra<br/>infrastructure.opendatahub.io"]
