    PC -->|synthetic data, eval| LLMAPI["LLM API Endpoints"]
    PC -->|model images| OCI["OCI Registries"]

    %% Key Python Library Dependencies
    PC -->|data processing| Pandas["pandas >=2.0"]
    PC -->|ML training| AutoGluon["AutoGluon<br/>(AutoML)"]
    PC -->|RAG pipeline| AI4RAG["ai4rag ==0.10.1"]
    PC -->|document parsing| Docling["Docling<br/>(PDF parsing)"]
    PC -->|synthetic data| SDGHub["sdg-hub<br/>>=0.7.0,<1.0"]
    PC -->|text splitting| LangChain["langchain-text-splitters"]

    %% Integration Points (consumers)
    DSP["Data Science Pipelines<br/>(KFP Orchestrator)"] -->|imports & runs| PC

